{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>鄺球自辯 前家翁鄺球 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲女模特兒蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）2023年遇害並遭碎 …</p><p></p>\n<p>鄺球自辯 前家翁鄺球 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲女模特兒蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）2023年遇害並遭碎屍，前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑被控謀殺及阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。案件踏入第39日審訊，鄺球出庭逐項解釋龍尾村單位內多件工具與物品用途，一批關鍵證物再成庭上焦點。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%9c%b0%e7%94%a2-%e5%bb%a3%e5%b7%9e%e9%a4%90%e5%bb%b3-%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e6%94%b6%e5%85%a5-2456370/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜69歲鄺球出庭自揭背景 離開警隊原因 公開收入來源 稱曾給3千萬蔡天鳳</a></p>\n<h2>鄺球解釋龍尾村多項工具用途成焦點</h2>\n<p>鄺球出庭自辯供稱，搬屋後原計劃找從事裝修工作的朋友「阿權」，在單位外設置圍欄，因此於深水埗購入一把新鋸及一把二手鋸，並準備用來鋸竹；兩個面罩則供自己與「阿權」使用，以免碎屑造成傷害；至於繩及索帶，他指是用來固定竹枝；大湯煲則擬作花盆種植攀藤植物，再利用煲身手挽綁緊竹繩；中型二手雪櫃則是「襟用」、「易清理」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e7%9c%8b%e5%9c%96%e4%bd%9c%e6%96%87-%e4%b8%bb%e6%8e%a7%e5%ae%98%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%bb%98%e8%aa%8d-2456137/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑答控方疑不攻自破洩密「佢講最後果句已經默認咗」</a></p>\n<h2>鄺球：絞肉機與龍尾村案絕對冇關係</h2>\n<p>面對絞肉機、大量刀具及大炸籬等證物，鄺球表示絞肉機與龍尾村案件「絕對冇關係」，聲稱是替內地從事飲食業的朋友「寶叔」購入，連同金屬盤合共花費8,000多元，機器其後交由對方員工運返內地。他又解釋，大炸籬用於打邊爐，牛肉刀及菜刀則方便自行處理整條肉類；帆布是為防止天花噴畫時油漆滴落，紙皮封窗只因自己會在屋內看書看報紙、聽音樂和睡午覺，窗簾太薄「遮唔到光」。上述說法均屬鄺球庭上供詞，控罪仍待法庭裁決。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-14%e5%90%8b%e5%a4%a7%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-2455975/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑棄指控父親鄺球為兇手原因 揭買大湯煲作用 網民：笑到碌地</a></p>\n<h2>金屬盤留現場成庭上轉折</h2>\n<p>案情另一焦點，是絞肉機金屬盤其後在龍尾村被檢獲。鄺球解釋，廚具店店員試機後重新包裝時弄破紙盒，只將機器放回箱內，遺漏金屬盤，因此機器已運返內地，金屬盤卻留在香港。他並稱之後再沒有見過該部絞肉機。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%80%a0%e5%81%87-%e7%8d%84%e4%b8%ad%e4%bf%a1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e7%94%9f%e6%97%a5-2455192/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑認花2年造假終講真相 答「是否自認聰明」旁聽爆笑 鄺港智呈獄中信大踢爆</a></p>\n<h2>鄺球親解嬰兒浴盆用途</h2>\n<p>律師問及他在龍尾村屋如何洗衣，鄺球表示，通常只會清洗襪子和內褲，其餘衣物則帶回荃灣尚文苑清洗。他亦從荃灣帶了一個嬰兒浴盆到村屋，稱用作浸泡衣物。\n</p>\n<p>至於單位內的帳篷，鄺球稱是從尚文苑帶過去的，可在進行水上運動時用來存放隨身物品。他又提到，已購入梳化床及檯櫈，並於2月11日送貨；至於電視機、洗衣機等其他電器，則打算待有空時一次過購買。</p>\n<p>鄺球、鄺港智及鄺港傑目前繼續就謀殺及阻止合法埋葬屍體罪受審，第39日庭上連串解釋能否獲法庭接納，仍是案件下一步關鍵。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-2454348/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑稱胞弟鄺港智殺害蔡天鳳 原因盤算部署惹熱議 網民揭開鄺家三父子自救方法</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179126625972757961_20781655186ac48dd506e4f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺球 28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179126625972757961_20781655186ac48dd506e4f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）於2023年2月慘遭碎屍遇害，案件震驚全城。（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e6%8e%a5%e6%94%be%e5%ad%b8-%e4%b8%83%e4%ba%ba%e8%bb%8a-2454496/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑指證胞弟鄺港智為兇手 詳述蔡分半鐘遇害經過 鄺球得知後沉默數秒回應</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e7%9c%9f%e9%9d%a2%e7%9b%ae-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%ba%ab%e4%bb%bd%e7%89%b9%e6%ae%8a-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%b0%8f%e7%94%b7%e4%ba%ba-2454105/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑自認家中身份特殊 揭蔡天鳳私下真面目 曾斥弟鄺港傑「似返個男人」</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e6%83%85%e5%a9%a6-2454035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑爆胞弟有女友 蔡知情後曾向子女哭訴 鄺球被逐出豪宅「住情婦屋企」導火線</a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%93%a1-%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e7%90%86%e7%94%b1-%e6%b3%95%e5%ae%98-%e9%ab%98%e7%ad%89%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-2453977/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案續審前法官解除1陪審員職務「不適合繼續擔任」理由曝光</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%a6%aa%e5%85%84%e5%a6%b9-%e8%b5%b4%e7%be%8e%e5%8d%87%e5%ad%b8-%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e9%84%ba-2453477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑身世學歷家庭背景 8字剖白與蔡天鳳關係 母親李瑞香職業首曝光</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/bb%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">bb浴盆</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%a7%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">大湯煲</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">嬰兒浴盆</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%b7%a5%e5%85%b7/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">工具</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/2456399\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於SundayKiss</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b5%a1%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網絡熱話</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.656312+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1737,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T10:01:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:55.826697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:55.826697+00:00","content_hash":"97bc1c492d2dcb2efbd8039dcdc9673446f031157c5ea305f512761e253f28e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}